OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to 'better explain'
OL,4,Avertical drinking term
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestminster City Council has published
OL,7,Fa revised licensing policy following a
OL,8,Fhigh-profile debate about what it
OL,9,Fcalled "vertical drinking".
OL,11,FLast month, the Conservative-run
OL,12,Fcouncil released a draft policy that
OL,13,Fencouraged pubs and bars to provide
OL,14,Fmore seated areas in place of standing
OL,15,Fones.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1788778549
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to 'better explain'
OL,4,Avertical drinking term
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was criticised by local businesses,
OL,7,Fthe government and London's mayor, Sir
OL,8,FSadiq Khan, who said that you "can't
OL,9,Frun a world-famous nightlife district
OL,10,Fwith a village-hall mindset". The
OL,11,Fcouncil later clarified that it had not
OL,12,Fplanned to ban people from standing as
OL,13,Fthey drank.
OL,15,FIn its latest statement, it said it was
OL,16,Ftaking on board feedback to better
OL,17,Fexplain technical terms like "vertical
OL,18,Fdrinking".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
